<title>SWEDEN: SWEDISH GOVT SHOULD HEAD CURRENCY POLICY - COMMISSION.</title>
<headline>SWEDISH GOVT SHOULD HEAD CURRENCY POLICY - COMMISSION.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Swedish government commission said on Wednesday that the government should take over the responsibility for currency policy from the central bank, the Riksbank.</p>
</text>
